:"/en/je-anilo-prema-dhana-karuna-prachura/","title":"Viraha-gīti"},"next":{"path":"/en/kripa-kara-vaishnava-thakura/","title":"Prārthanā Lālasāmayī"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":120,"author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur","first_line":"ei-bāra karuṇā kara vaiṣṇava gosāñi"},"title":["Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ei-bāra karuṇā kara vaiṣṇava gosāñi","patita-pāvana tomā vine keha nāi"],"translation":["O Vaiṣṇava Goswāmī, please be merciful to me this time. You are the saviour of the fallen; without you there is no one."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kāhāra nikaṭe gele pāpa dūre yāya","emana dayāla prabhu kebā kothā pāya"],"translation":["Just by being in your presence, sins go far away. Where can anyone find such kindness?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gaṅgāra paraśa haile paśchāte pāvana","darśane pavitra kara – ei tomāra guṇa"],"translation":["Merely by the touch of the waters of the sacred Ganges one becomes liberated, even if he is the lowest of mankind; but just by seeing you, the same effect is achieved. Such is your quality."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["hari-sthāne aparādhe tāre hari-nāma","tomā-sthāne aparādhe nāhika eḍāna"],"translation":["If one commits an offence at the feet of Lord Hari, he can be forgiven if he chants the Holy Name. But if one offends you, there is no salvation for him."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["tomāra hṛdaye sadā govinda-viśrāma","govinda kahena mama vaiṣṇava parāṇa"],"translation":["In your heart Govinda is always resting. Śrī Govinda Himself says, “My devotees are My life and soul.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["prati janme kari āśā charaṇera dhūli","narottame kara dayā āpanāra bali’"],"translation":["I hope that in every birth I will obtain the dust of your lotus feet. Śrī Narottam prays, “Please, O Vaiṣṇava Goswāmī, be kind unto me.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-ei-baro-koruna","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ei-baro-koruna-koro_1","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Vaiṣṇava-Vijñāpti-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/ei-vara-karuna-kara-vaishnava-gosani/","description":"Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"ei-vara-karuna-kara-vaishnava-gosani"}}